{"version":1,"content":"<p>HOY全新原創處境劇《你的保安李寶安》，昨晚（26日）晚上8時首播，對撼無綫同時段《愛‧回家之三代同糖》，據最新數據顯示，《李寶安》首播收視不俗，最高收視衝上9.4點，對撼策略暫時取得初步成功，而HOY還採取跨平台策略，在YouTube連續上架4集供觀眾欣賞，短時間內第一集累積32萬次點擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.497973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:50:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:38.108028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.129676+00:00","content_hash":"7ef20b9bebfbec8fdb703c79c2aaca86999c36078e60893f7c82830afb4f1438","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}